config GUIDANCE_ENABLE
    bool "Guidance (M5)"
    default n
    depends on FMS_ENABLE
    help
        Build the M5 Guidance core (NONE obstacle source only:
        takeoff/point-to-point/hold/return/land reference generation with the
        anchor+24 preview and READY/ACTIVE lifecycle). A*/local map and
        obstacle avoidance are not admitted on the H723 profile and missions requiring
        avoidance are rejected. Off by default; no firmware default changes.
